 in realtà le presenze oscure provano ad avvisarla e a metterla in guardia da qualcosa o qualcuno. La spiegazione agli inquietanti fenomeni si avrà indagando l'oscuro passato della casa, e cosa avvenne alla famiglia che ci abitava prima.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"There is evidence to suggest that children are highly susceptible to paranormal phenomena. They see what adults cannot. They believe what adults deny. And they are trying to warn us.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2007-02-02","status":"Released","rating":5.751,"ratingCount":907,"genres":["Mistero","Thriller","Horror"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"84m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":37917,"name":"Kristen Stewart","role":"Jess","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xldswdQ1VnpcOf2wZMPguZ3avgO.jpg"},{"id":32597,"name":"Dylan McDermott","role":"Roy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3i69RNLuL7KOD9pCmHQYruhcOdn.jpg"},{"id":14698,"name":"Penelope Ann Miller","role":"Denise","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oeeeKR5IPch6faXl33ySqTiH42e.jpg"},{"id":38405,"name":"John Corbett","role":"Burwell","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iXKGteGZA3VTh88LBw4pXJY6cam.jpg"},{"id":53117,"name":"Dustin Milligan","role":"Bobby","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tHIrZBMjQuv2I6ptw3fYCkpJsNM.jpg"},{"id":12643,"name":"William B. Davis","role":"Colby Price","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b4imZtShd4kK6xFu2ccuPd0fqXA.jpg"},{"id":61131,"name":"Evan Turner","role":"Ben"},{"id":61132,"name":"Theodore Turner","role":"Ben"},{"id":15011,"name":"Brent Briscoe","role":"Plume","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4N7ZjV0Tb2EwwRzOBGp7h01oXVu.jpg"},{"id":8338,"name":"Jodelle Ferland","role":"Michael Rollins","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6rO3WF9VWfQOpVA7LtbriJmHH7N.jpg"},{"id":61133,"name":"Michael Daingerfield","role":"Police Officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org